{"logId": "814d04e5-f2dd-455b-9323-d906ebb151e3", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [168, 140, 459, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[168.0, 140.0], [459.0, 140.0], [459.0, 173.0], [168.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "b. 关注居家食品安全，具备食品安全常识", "block_bbox": [186, 215, 521, 240], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[186.0, 215.0], [521.0, 215.0], [521.0, 240.0], [186.0, 240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、有良好的居家生活习惯和居家乐趣", "block_bbox": [163, 246, 472, 271], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 246.0], [472.0, 246.0], [472.0, 271.0], [163.0, 271.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）居家生活的能力，会做日常的基础饭菜", "block_bbox": [174, 276, 523, 301], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 276.0], [523.0, 276.0], [523.0, 301.0], [174.0, 301.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）配备适用的应急药箱、急救药品", "block_bbox": [175, 307, 472, 331], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 307.0], [472.0, 307.0], [472.0, 331.0], [175.0, 331.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）培养居家的兴趣爱好，热情地创造居家时光的美好（如养花鸟鱼、读书、下棋、喝茶、弹吉他、绘画、手工、烹饪、烘焙等）", "block_bbox": [163, 337, 1007, 392], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 337.0], [1007.0, 337.0], [1007.0, 392.0], [163.0, 392.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）居家氛围融洽舒适，独自居住的享受自己的生活，与家人同住的相互关心与呵护，创造家庭的亲情与快乐", "block_bbox": [163, 399, 1009, 453], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[162.56146240234375, 399.0533752441406], [1007.5614624023438, 392.0534362792969], [1008.0000610351562, 445.0000915527344], [163.00006103515625, 452.0000305175781]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "4、遵守居家公共文明", "block_bbox": [165, 461, 345, 484], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 461.0], [345.0, 461.0], [345.0, 484.0], [165.0, 484.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）深夜进入小区不按车辆喇叭、不大声喧哗", "block_bbox": [175, 491, 542, 515], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 491.0], [542.0, 491.0], [542.0, 515.0], [175.0, 515.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）晚上10点至早上6点之间禁止地板发出噪音影响他人", "block_bbox": [174, 521, 629, 546], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 521.0], [629.0, 521.0], [629.0, 546.0], [174.0, 546.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）家门口禁止长时间堆放生活垃圾，及时下楼放入垃圾桶", "block_bbox": [175, 552, 649, 577], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 552.0], [649.0, 552.0], [649.0, 577.0], [175.0, 577.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[44]", "block_bbox": [572, 716, 612, 739], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[572.0, 716.0], [611.0, 716.0], [611.0, 738.0], [572.0, 738.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [205, 900, 498, 933], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[205.0, 900.0], [498.0, 900.0], [498.0, 933.0], [205.0, 933.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：居家环境非常干净整洁，且布局合理、温馨舒适，享受品质的居家生活。（品质、温馨）", "block_bbox": [200, 975, 1054, 1002], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 975.0], [1054.0, 975.0], [1054.0, 1002.0], [200.0, 1002.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：保持常态化非常干净整洁的居家环境，不只是大体上，而是有精细化的居家收纳和整理，分类清晰、井井有条。有居家生活的标准和追求，在实用的基础上注重和讲究品质，不随意增添，居家整体环境温馨舒适。同时达到私家车辆安全、整洁的相应标准。", "block_bbox": [199, 1022, 1052, 1109], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 1022.0], [1052.0, 1022.0], [1052.0, 1109.0], [199.0, 1109.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1151, 320, 1175], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1151.0], [320.0, 1151.0], [320.0, 1175.0], [202.0, 1175.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、常态化非常干净整洁的居家环境，有精细化的居家收纳和整理", "block_bbox": [217, 1190, 738, 1215], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 1190.0], [738.0, 1190.0], [738.0, 1215.0], [217.0, 1215.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）随手清洁和整理的生活习惯", "block_bbox": [229, 1221, 490, 1245], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[229.0, 1221.0], [490.0, 1221.0], [490.0, 1245.0], [229.0, 1245.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）精细化地收纳整理，橱柜、衣柜、鞋柜、抽屉、储物柜等物品收纳规整有序", "block_bbox": [227, 1251, 862, 1277], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[227.0, 1251.0], [862.0, 1251.0], [862.0, 1277.0], [227.0, 1277.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）厨房、卫生间等区域，整洁、无异味", "block_bbox": [229, 1282, 561, 1307], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[229.0, 1282.0], [561.0, 1282.0], [561.0, 1307.0], [229.0, 1307.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）卧室温馨舒适", "block_bbox": [230, 1312, 382, 1337], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[230.0, 1312.0], [382.0, 1312.0], [382.0, 1337.0], [230.0, 1337.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、功能性的电器或设施齐全、实用，保障居家生活的便捷和舒适", "block_bbox": [217, 1343, 738, 1368], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 1343.0], [738.0, 1343.0], [738.0, 1368.0], [217.0, 1368.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、合理规划房间空间和家具布局，通畅舒心", "block_bbox": [218, 1374, 578, 1398], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1374.0], [578.0, 1374.0], [578.0, 1398.0], [218.0, 1398.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、选择品质好、简约的居家床品、用品等，安全、健康、舒适", "block_bbox": [217, 1405, 722, 1430], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 1405.0], [722.0, 1405.0], [722.0, 1430.0], [217.0, 1430.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[45]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "block_id": 24, "block_order": null, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7814297676086426, "coordinate": [168, 140, 459, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[168.0, 140.0], [459.0, 140.0], [459.0, 173.0], [168.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7655885815620422, "coordinate": [186, 215, 521, 240], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[186.0, 215.0], [521.0, 215.0], [521.0, 240.0], [186.0, 240.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7823993563652039, "coordinate": [163, 246, 472, 271], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 246.0], [472.0, 246.0], [472.0, 271.0], [163.0, 271.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7925729751586914, "coordinate": [174, 276, 523, 301], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[174.0, 276.0], [523.0, 276.0], [523.0, 301.0], [174.0, 301.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8050731420516968, "coordinate": [175, 307, 472, 331], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[175.0, 307.0], [472.0, 307.0], [472.0, 331.0], [175.0, 331.0]